                        "entry_id": "ef63575d-c53d-302e-9013-b4f1841e7eba",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Friendly and cheerful."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "21381b8a-ee7a-40f8-b827-fe32079f4607",
                                "sense_id": "5228e649-19e5-3ed5-b87e-5b4bbd67f2d6",
                                "text": "George Relph plays the part of the Vicar of the Parish, a railway enthusiast, who becomes amateur engine driver, with Sir Godfrey Tearle (the Bishop) as his fireman, while Stanley Holloway is the genial toper who provides the cash to buy the line."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c5fe359b-663d-3229-8e37-2d574c30ea15",
                        "entry_id": "ef63575d-c53d-302e-9013-b4f1841e7eba",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Pleasantly mild and warm."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "especially"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c7c4f96d-67af-3644-804f-f69cf9e4eeb6",
                        "entry_id": "ef63575d-c53d-302e-9013-b4f1841e7eba",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Marked by genius."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "796d0d9f-0628-4f86-83c7-33da70cf5e86",
                                "sense_id": "c7c4f96d-67af-3644-804f-f69cf9e4eeb6",
                                "text": "Men of genius have so often attacht the highest value to their less genial works."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1cc73d82-0ecd-490b-9254-ae4085db2816",
                                "sense_id": "c7c4f96d-67af-3644-804f-f69cf9e4eeb6",
                                "text": "About fifty years later, in 1675, the Danish astronomer Ole Roemer (1644-1710) had the genial idea of using astronomical rather than terrestrial distances."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7a5c2847-c5c5-39c1-aeb4-277b17f2d597",
                        "entry_id": "ef63575d-c53d-302e-9013-b4f1841e7eba",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Contributing to, or concerned in, propagation or production; generative; procreative; productive."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5f16973f-34ce-43b2-a7ee-c68180992f46",
                                "sense_id": "7a5c2847-c5c5-39c1-aeb4-277b17f2d597",
                                "text": "The well breath'd youth, hot-mettled, and flush with genial juices, was now fairly in for making me know my driver.",
                                "translation": "Fanny Hill",
                                "english": "Fanny Hill"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fc0a6ada-a285-4e66-a9ca-11fa3368a259",
                                "sense_id": "7a5c2847-c5c5-39c1-aeb4-277b17f2d597",
                                "text": "the genial bed"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "765a84e7-81d6-49c3-b927-09c7516734d6",
                                "sense_id": "7a5c2847-c5c5-39c1-aeb4-277b17f2d597",
                                "text": "Creator Venus, genial power of love."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1d24f02e-de04-397c-832a-112de792cb74",
                        "entry_id": "ef63575d-c53d-302e-9013-b4f1841e7eba",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Belonging to one's genius or natural character; native; natural; inborn."
